The YAML 1.1 boolean-looking literal "yes" is written single-quoted so it reloads as a string.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
---
# My Plan
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md answer=yes
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 ---
 title: My Plan
+answer: 'yes'
 ---
 # My Plan
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: answer=yes
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
answer: 'yes'
---
# My Plan
